2. Add the `HasUuids` trait to the model and indicate which columns are unique IDs:

```php
    public function uniqueIds()
    {
        return ['uuid'];
    }
```

3. Populate the database and attempt to replicate a model

```php
$user = User::first();
$otherUser = tap($user->replicate())->save();
